      <ul>
        <li><a href="/modelling/adr/adr-0068">ADR-0068 — full proposed standards lifecycle decision</a></li>
        <li><a href="/governance/change-management">Change management</a> — constitutional machinery and the current technical SOP.</li>
        <li><a href="/governance/meetings-and-feedback">Meetings &amp; feedback</a> — channels, records and proposed operating cadence.</li>
        <li><a href="/governance/data-stewardship">Data stewardship &amp; decision rights</a> — the earlier stewardship operating-model proposal.</li>
      </ul>

</Layout>
